* The incubator's cave lit (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our own script;
* owner, 2026-11-23, softening the places that push creatures hardest:
* "Incubator darkness"). Run by openc2e after the world loads (Additions
* folder); safe to repeat.
*
* The world file leaves the cave around the incubator almost dark: the
* incubator's room at light 3, the room east of it at 12, and the pond, its
* banks and the cave over it at 0 (the open air is 100-255 by day). Every
* norn, grendel and ettin has a gene that raises Sleepiness in the dark, so
* newborns there kept getting sleepier. The cave is now lit like the rooms
* just below it (150): it still makes creatures a little sleepy, less than
* half as much as before, and is no longer dark enough to keep cave germs
* (under 80).
*
* A helper object goes to the middle of each room in turn and sets its
* light (LITE is the light of TARG's room), then goes. Each room is also
* given a light source (LSRC 1): the day and night (World::tickDaylight)
* took these rooms, whose ceilings meet the sky, as partly outdoors and
* dimmed them to about 110 at night; a lamp-lit room keeps its light.

inst
new: simp blnk 1 0 0 0
setv attr 16
* the room east of the incubator (15), the incubator's (16), the pond's
* east bank (17), the air over the pond (18), the pond (19), its west end
* (20) and the cave over it (219)
mvto 5594 800 setv lite 150 setv lsrc 1
mvto 5170 800 setv lite 150 setv lsrc 1
mvto 4760 800 setv lite 150 setv lsrc 1
mvto 4494 850 setv lite 150 setv lsrc 1
mvto 4494 915 setv lite 150 setv lsrc 1
mvto 4329 800 setv lite 150 setv lsrc 1
mvto 4500 720 setv lite 150 setv lsrc 1
kill targ
slow
